        64.18982696533203
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "state of the trajectories in lieu of a hard constraint.",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        67.23828125,
        522.4841918945312,
        76.14484405517578
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "NanoMap with a history of 50 point clouds was used. The",
      "bbox": [
        323.16302490234375,
        79.30926513671875,
        558.001220703125,
        88.21582794189453
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "system was successful in navigation to goal for 91 trials, of",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        91.2642822265625,
        558.0009155273438,
        100.17084503173828
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "which only 15.4% broke the obstacle constraint, as shown in",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        103.21929931640625,
        558.0009155273438,
        112.12586212158203
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Figure 2a.",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        115.17529296875,
        354.5946044921875,
        124.08185577392578
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "To highlight the trajectory optimizer’s use of the NanoMap",
      "bbox": [
        323.16302490234375,
        127.24627685546875,
        558.0013427734375,
        136.15283203125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "measurement history in these trials, we tracked the number",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        139.2012939453125,
        558.0010375976562,
        148.10784912109375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "of queries that occurred at a point cloud history depth for",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        151.15631103515625,
        558.0010375976562,
        160.0628662109375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "each iteration during the trial. Figure 3 shows the NanoMap",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        163.1123046875,
        558.0009765625,
        172.01885986328125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "search depth during direct transcription across all trajectory",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        175.06732177734375,
        558.0009765625,
        183.973876953125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "generation iterations. Figure 4 shows the NanoMap search",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        187.0223388671875,
        558.0009765625,
        195.92889404296875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "depth during one iteration as the ﬁxed-wing turns a corner.",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        198.97735595703125,
        558.0009155273438,
        207.8839111328125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "For these data, it is clear that the optimizer makes use",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        210.932373046875,
        558.0009765625,
        219.83892822265625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "of NanoMap’s point cloud history as it performs aerobatic",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        222.88739013671875,
        558.0007934570312,
        231.7939453125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "maneuvers that require the ﬁxed-wing to quickly turn outside",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        234.8433837890625,
        558.0010375976562,
        243.74993896484375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "of its ﬁeld of view.",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        246.79840087890625,
        391.8347473144531,
        255.7049560546875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Next, we performed the same simulation using only the",
      "bbox": [
        323.16302490234375,
        258.869384765625,
        558.0015869140625,
        267.77593994140625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "most recent point cloud measurement instead of NanoMap’s",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        270.82440185546875,
        558.0009765625,
        279.73095703125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "history. When doing so, the system was only successful 58",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        282.7793884277344,
        558.0009155273438,
        291.6859436035156
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "times, of which 57.4% broke the obstacle constraint (Figure",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        294.7353820800781,
        558.0009765625,
        303.6419372558594
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "2c). The failure case for the majority of these trials was due",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        306.69036865234375,
        558.0007934570312,
        315.596923828125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "to the RRT global path planning failure.",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        318.6453552246094,
        478.1506042480469,
        327.5519104003906
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Thus, to evaluate the effect of using NanoMap on trajec-",
      "bbox": [
        323.16302490234375,
        330.71636962890625,
        558.0015258789062,
        339.6229248046875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "tory generation in particular, we allowed the RRT planner to",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        342.67236328125,
        558.0010375976562,
        351.57891845703125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "access NanoMap, but restricted the direct transcription tra-",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        354.6273498535156,
        558.0010375976562,
        363.5339050292969
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "jectory generator to the most recent point cloud. The system",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        366.58233642578125,
        558.0009155273438,
        375.4888916015625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "was only successful in reaching the goal without collision 80",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        378.5373229980469,
        558.0009155273438,
        387.4438781738281
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "times, of which 22.5% broke the obstacle constraint (Figure",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        390.4923095703125,
        558.0009765625,
        399.39886474609375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "2b).",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        402.4472961425781,
        328.9707946777344,
        411.3538513183594
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "C. Experiment 3: Noise",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        422.2049560546875,
        411.2120361328125,
        430.792724609375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The second set of simulation experiments showcases the",
      "bbox": [
        323.16302490234375,
        437.6163024902344,
        558.0012817382812,
        446.5228576660156
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "importance of compensating for sensor uncertainty. Posi-",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        449.5712890625,
        558.0009155273438,
        458.47784423828125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "tional noise, N(diag(0, 0, 0), diag(0.1, 0.1, 0.1)), was in-",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        460.8089599609375,
        557.9973754882812,
        470.4328308105469
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "jected into the ﬁxed-wing state to simulate state estima-",
      "bbox": [
        313.199951171875,
        473.48126220703125,
        558.0007934570312,
        482.3878173828125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "tion noise. Noise was also injected into the depth images,",
      "bbox": [
        313.199951171875,
        485.4362487792969,
        558.0009155273438,
        494.3428039550781
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "N(0, 0.316), to simulate depth camera noise. To evaluate",
      "bbox": [
        313.199951171875,
        496.6739196777344,
        557.9959716796875,
        506.29779052734375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "the effects of noise only on trajectory generation, a global",
      "bbox": [
        313.199951171875,
        509.34722900390625,
        558.0009155273438,
        518.2537841796875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "path to goal is provided in lieu of the RRT planner.",
      "bbox": [
        313.199951171875,
        521.30224609375,
        525.8116455078125,
        530.2088012695312
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Three different constraints were evaluated; distance to",
      "bbox": [
        323.1629638671875,
        533.3732299804688,
        558.0013427734375,
        542.27978515625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "obstacles, distance to obstacles with standard deviation in-",
      "bbox": [
        313.199951171875,
        545.3282470703125,
        558.0008544921875,
        554.2348022460938
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "ﬂation, and probability of collision. For the probability of",
      "bbox": [
        313.199951171875,
        557.2841796875,
        558.0009155273438,
        566.1907348632812
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "collision constraint, we set a max probability of collision",
      "bbox": [
        313.199951171875,
        569.2391967773438,
        558.0008544921875,
        578.145751953125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "of 0.5 and a robot radius of 1.2 meters. For the distance",
      "bbox": [
        313.199951171875,
        581.1942138671875,
        558.0009765625,
        590.1007690429688
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "to obstacles with standard deviation inﬂation constraint,",
      "bbox": [
        313.199951171875,
        593.1492309570312,
        558.0008544921875,
        602.0557861328125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "we inﬂate the collision radius using the standard deviation",
      "bbox": [
        313.199951171875,
        605.104248046875,
        558.0009765625,
        614.0108032226562
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "values.",
      "bbox": [
        313.199951171875,
        617.0592041015625,
        340.89599609375,
        625.9657592773438
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The distance to obstacle constraint had 99 successful",
      "bbox": [
        323.1629638671875,
        629.1312255859375,
        558.0012817382812,
        638.0377807617188
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "trials, of which only 17.2% broke the obstacle constraint",
      "bbox": [
        313.199951171875,
        641.0862426757812,
        558.0008544921875,
        649.9927978515625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "(Figure 2d). The distance to obstacles with standard deviation",
      "bbox": [
        313.199951171875,
        653.041259765625,
        558.0009155273438,
        661.9478149414062
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "inﬂation trials had 95 successful trials, of which only 1%",
      "bbox": [
        313.199951171875,
        664.9962158203125,
        558.0009155273438,
        673.9027709960938
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "broke the obstacle constraint (Figure 2e). The probability of",
      "bbox": [
        313.199951171875,
        676.9512329101562,
        558.0009765625,
        685.8577880859375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "collision constraint had 100 successful trials, of which only",
      "bbox": [
        313.199951171875,
        688.9072265625,
        558.0007934570312,
        697.8137817382812
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "1% broke the obstacle constraint (Figure 2f). Thus, we can",
      "bbox": [
        313.199951171875,
        700.8622436523438,
        558.0009155273438,
        709.768798828125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "conclude that explicitly taking the covariance of our state",
      "bbox": [
        313.199951171875,
        712.8172607421875,
        558.0009765625,
        721.7238159179688
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "and noise into account beneﬁts planning.",
      "bbox": [
        313.199951171875,
        724.772216796875,
        480.89031982421875,
        733.6787719726562
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    }
